      "en": "Of all clean birds you may eat.",
      "ko": "무릇 정한 새는 너희가 먹을찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a39ef9e7b56d296efe83d246332839c7a1b1ada0611343f6b806b571ad3b3834",
      "translation_text_hash": "5b28eb5a44032ce97cc248b05cc9da11a65935312566b0fad53b178424b27fd8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
