      ],
      "en": "You shall surely tithe all the increase of your seed, that which comes out of the field year by year.",
      "ko": "너는 마땅히 매년에 토지 소산의 십일조를 드릴것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "8be692ce4733b8cf2b19672164465a6b2dcd450dd1dbc8793927d3eb82d64469",
      "translation_text_hash": "2af93f285e6351797d2e0657c3d62d227c2eecb8d524fb5199a16e0aefa6fa52",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
